slow-moving, offering hope to grieving families.

5
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:06,000
But when Ava enters a quarantine zone searching for her missing husband, she uncovers the horrifying truth: the
undead are growing more violent, more relentless, and more dangerous with every passing hour.

