01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
We Bury the Dead is a 2025 zombie survival horror thriller
film written and directed by Zak Hilditch.

13
01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
It stars Daisy Ridley, Mark Coles Smith, and Brenton Thwaites.

14
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
The plot centers on a woman desperate to find her missing husband and
follows her journey as she takes on grief and the undead.

15
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
We Bury the Dead had its world premiere in March at the
2025 South by Southwest Film & TV Festival.

16
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
It had a theatrical release in North America on January 2, 2026, and will
release in Australia and New Zealand on February 5, 2026.

17
01:25:00,000 --> 01:25:06,000
The film explores themes of australia, undead, zombie, missing person, military.

18
01:30:00,000 --> 01:30:06,000
The tone is intense and dark and thought_provoking.
